Everyone runs into a YAFM and/or YAFMC at some point (that's Yet
Another Funny Message (Combination) if you're not sure).  To hopefully
bring some laughs everyone's workday, here are some that I have run
into over the past while.  Some are on purpose, some not so much:

>"You hear some noises.  You hear chewing.
>The black unicorn has a very bad case of stomach acid.
>The black unicorn dies!"
If I remember correctly, this one was due to me causing conflict in a
treasure zoo with a cockatrice and something acidic around.  Blind due
to a wand of lightning.
It is just *so* satisfying to see something else have a food-related
fatality.


>"Angmagssalik says 'You be careful with my corpse!'"
... Yeah.  That... that's disturbing.


>"You suddenly vomit!--More--
>The succubus seems dismayed at your lack of response.--More--
>The succubus hits!  The succubus hits!  You can move again."
What?!  My respose was anything but lacking.
P.S.  Never anger chaotic gods, or you will be forced to survive on dog
food for a while and because they just will *not* be mollified.


>"You will always remember the invisible smurf..."
Yes, that seems like something I would remember.    I purposely drank a
potion of hallucination before succubus dancing to see what funny
things would come up.  Some were even worse (mother-in-law...)  Wish
cameras took pictures though.
g - a blessed very burnt blurry picture of you having sex with a naked
invisible succubus (worth 450 zorkmids)


>"You see here a cursed gray stone.  It eats a Green-elf corpse."
I knew loadstones were bad things to have, but...


>"My, that was a yummy porn elemental corpse!"
My personal favorite name for fruit.  Looks like a corpse when dropped
too.  Hopefully people find my bones file and laugh.

Anyone have any other good fruit names? Tried 'chickatrice corpse', but
TDT is too canny for that.



